WEBVTT

00:10.884 --> 00:13.594
<b>How stupid are you?</b>

00:22.484 --> 00:28.274
<b>I was sure you'd cry,
Sidekick, cry for me...</b>

00:28.274 --> 00:34.454
<b>That's why I meant to have said
my farewells on that boat, but you...</b>

00:34.454 --> 00:38.414
<b>Kimi, you like me too,
too much, don't you?</b>

00:41.584 --> 00:47.004
<b>I'm sorry I yanked you around
so much over three years.</b>

00:47.004 --> 00:51.054
<b>I wish I could have more chances
to hear you say, "That's absurd,"</b>

00:51.054 --> 00:54.224
<b>and see your face in profile
when you sighed.</b>

00:55.554 --> 01:00.224
<b>I wanted to see you laugh
many, many times.</b>

01:01.854 --> 01:05.524
<b>I didn't... want to die.</b>

01:11.984 --> 01:19.324
<b>And yet... I promised you, that time,
that whatever incidents or problems</b>

01:19.324 --> 01:24.124
<b>you got tangled up in with your
trouble-magnet nature, I'd protect you.</b>

01:25.124 --> 01:30.884
<b>So, Kimi, keep sleeping as you are now,
with your mind at ease.</b>

01:34.304 --> 01:40.724
<b>When you next awaken... I'll be gone.</b>

01:40.724 --> 01:42.684
<b>But it's okay.</b>

01:42.684 --> 01:46.484
<b>I'm certain that, in my place,
she will save you.</b>

01:46.484 --> 01:52.774
<b>And in my place, I expect
she'll embrace you, too.</b>

01:54.944 --> 01:58.534
<b>In the end, I failed to hand
this over to her, didn't I?</b>

02:02.834 --> 02:05.244
<b>I need to think of a name, too.</b>

02:07.044 --> 02:14.054
<b>A new name for this body... in its rebirth
once I've suppressed Hel's consciousness.</b>

02:17.554 --> 02:21.644
<b>Okay, Sidekick. Remember this...</b>

02:21.644 --> 02:27.734
<b>The name of the person who will
someday awaken you from your sleep is...</b>

02:30.644 --> 02:34.654
Episode 12

02:30.644 --> 02:34.654
Episode 12

02:30.644 --> 02:34.654
Those Dizzying Three Years I Spent with You

02:30.644 --> 02:34.654
Those Dizzying Three Years I Spent with You

02:33.364 --> 02:40.034
<b>It's been a year since I've seen you.
You've got a meaner look in your eye.</b>

02:41.454 --> 02:46.584
<b>You're the one who's changed everything--
from your appearance on down.</b>

02:48.704 --> 02:53.084
<b>So you were still in there...
at the heart of things.</b>

02:53.084 --> 02:56.844
<b>I'm just borrowing her body
for a little while.</b>

02:56.844 --> 03:00.134
<b>I'm not thinking of seizing it
for myself or anything.</b>

03:06.104 --> 03:10.184
<b>But I'm glad we could
see each other, Siesta.</b>

03:17.114 --> 03:22.954
<b>Siesta, that's enough talk. We need
to do something about <i>that </i>first.</b>

03:22.954 --> 03:27.544
<b>You're right. That's why
I came, after all.</b>

03:27.544 --> 03:28.874
<b>Well, then.</b>

03:32.214 --> 03:36.254
<b>Be my sidekick.</b>

03:37.844 --> 03:41.474
<b>Yeah. If such is your command...</b>

03:42.934 --> 03:44.764
<b>...legendary detective.</b>

03:46.644 --> 03:47.894
<b>Here.</b>

03:49.724 --> 03:51.024
<b>Here it comes.</b>

04:07.164 --> 04:10.044
<b>Huh? Do you really want
to be on that side?</b>

04:10.044 --> 04:13.124
<b>Eh? Is that a problem?</b>

04:13.124 --> 04:16.254
<b>That thing can no longer attack me,</b>

04:16.254 --> 04:20.254
<b>so I'd say it would be advantageous
for me to be in front of it.</b>

04:20.254 --> 04:22.384
<b>I'd forgotten that.</b>

04:22.384 --> 04:25.724
<b>I'm surprised you haven't improved
on your lack of focus.</b>

04:35.984 --> 04:38.524
<b>Come to think of it,
you were always that way.</b>

04:38.524 --> 04:40.694
<b>Saying, "For tonight, I'm getting us
a room in a resort hotel,"</b>

04:40.694 --> 04:45.324
<b>then marching into the casino in high
spirits and blowing all our money...</b>

04:47.574 --> 04:50.454
<b>That was because you said you had had it
with pooping outdoors and got all weepy,</b>

04:50.454 --> 04:54.584
<b>so the only hope was to shoot for turning
our finances around in one fell swoop--</b>

04:54.584 --> 04:58.884
<b>Stop coming up with fake memories. If it's
about the time I wounded your pride</b>

04:58.884 --> 05:03.884
<b>by accidentally seeing you taking--
er, doing your "business" outdoors,</b>

05:03.884 --> 05:05.054
<b>I could apologize.</b>

05:05.054 --> 05:08.844
<b>We're in combat! Stop dredging
up uncalled-for stuff!</b>

05:15.024 --> 05:19.944
<b>Besides, you exposed yourself
in an embarrassing light too, right?</b>

05:19.944 --> 05:21.824
<b>What are you referring to?</b>

05:24.324 --> 05:28.364
<b>You know, that one time...
We got into bed together and--</b>

05:28.364 --> 05:31.084
<b>Hmm, I can't seem to hear you.</b>

05:31.084 --> 05:34.004
<b>Then stop pointing your gun at me!</b>

05:36.834 --> 05:38.254
<b>Kimi.</b>

05:38.254 --> 05:42.594
<b>Have you forgotten we're in combat?
Don't dredge up uncalled-for stuff.</b>

05:42.594 --> 05:48.054
<b>I'm positive that was my line...
This is absurd.</b>

05:58.814 --> 06:03.654
<b>And? In the end, how did things turn out?</b>

06:03.654 --> 06:05.114
<b>Turn out?</b>

06:05.114 --> 06:12.914
<b>I mean, when we slept in the same bed,
after that did we... do it?</b>

06:12.914 --> 06:17.204
<b>I thought you didn't want me to
dredge up any uncalled-for stuff.</b>

06:17.204 --> 06:19.294
<b>No, the truth is, being
preoccupied with that,</b>

06:19.294 --> 06:22.214
<b>I've been unable to
move on from this world.</b>

06:22.214 --> 06:26.094
<b>Well, the thrill of being
reunited is now gone.</b>

06:26.094 --> 06:30.224
<b>And? What did you really come back to do?</b>

06:51.994 --> 06:53.954
<b>This is off the rails.</b>

07:15.264 --> 07:17.434
<b>"I want you to help him."</b>

07:17.434 --> 07:18.644
<b>Huh?</b>

07:19.894 --> 07:23.904
<b>The truth is, she asked that of me.</b>

07:24.864 --> 07:27.194
<b>Natsunagi asked you?</b>

07:28.114 --> 07:33.534
<b>Uh-huh. Honestly, I had intended
to leave everything up to her.</b>

07:33.534 --> 07:38.914
<b>But this is the last time.
It won't happen again.</b>

07:40.374 --> 07:43.084
<b>Yeah, I realize that.</b>

07:45.214 --> 07:46.544
<b>Sidekick.</b>

07:51.554 --> 07:53.514
<b>H-Hey!</b>

08:00.274 --> 08:03.274
<b>My body aloft in the air...</b>

08:03.274 --> 08:07.734
<b>Siesta saved me that other
time, too, just like this.</b>

08:12.704 --> 08:20.244
<b>No--it wasn't just that time.
All the time, in every place...</b>

08:20.244 --> 08:22.164
<b>...you were always...</b>

08:25.084 --> 08:26.424
<b>When it comes down to it,</b>

08:26.424 --> 08:30.504
<b>having you always yanking me around
seems to be exactly what I needed.</b>

08:32.054 --> 08:34.884
<b>What's suddenly come over you, Sidekick?</b>

08:36.514 --> 08:39.354
<b>Were you lonely without me?</b>

08:39.354 --> 08:42.274
<b>Could I have been that spineless?</b>

08:44.064 --> 08:45.694
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

08:46.774 --> 08:48.484
<b>Don't apologize.</b>

08:48.484 --> 08:51.364
<b>I'm sorry I died before you.</b>

08:51.364 --> 08:53.904
<b>I said don't apologize.</b>

08:57.704 --> 09:03.084
<b>The truth is, I wasn't planning to
travel with you for years on end.</b>

09:03.084 --> 09:06.424
<b>But before I knew it,
three years had passed.</b>

09:07.714 --> 09:13.764
<b>I'm sure it was because I was more
fond of you than I had thought.</b>

09:13.764 --> 09:20.184
<b>You birdbrain. You and I weren't lovers;
we weren't even friends.</b>

09:20.184 --> 09:24.774
<b>Detective and sidekick... we were only
some peculiar sort of business partners.</b>

09:24.774 --> 09:29.944
<b>I realize that. You didn't think
of me as anything special,</b>

09:29.944 --> 09:34.404
<b>and I didn't give you
any special treatment.</b>

09:34.404 --> 09:40.584
<b>And yet... those dizzying three
years I spent with you...</b>

09:40.584 --> 09:44.624
<b>...are the best memories I have.</b>

09:50.424 --> 09:52.754
<b>How stupid are you, Kimi?</b>

09:56.304 --> 09:59.474
<b>Why try to play tough with a dead person?</b>

09:59.474 --> 10:03.724
<b>You held up great on
your own this past year.</b>

10:21.454 --> 10:23.954
<b>You asked if I was lonely without you...</b>

10:25.164 --> 10:28.754
<b>Sorry, but I had such boisterous
people around me,</b>

10:28.754 --> 10:32.504
<b>I barely had time to think about that.</b>

10:32.504 --> 10:35.764
<b>So you see, I'm not alone.</b>

10:35.764 --> 10:39.474
<b>I see. Nurture those friendships.</b>

10:41.394 --> 10:43.014
<b>Hey, Siesta...</b>

10:43.014 --> 10:44.314
<b>What is it?</b>

10:44.314 --> 10:51.604
<b>Just to follow up from before--about what
happened when we got into bed together...</b>

10:51.604 --> 10:56.654
<b>I guess it's appropriate to say...
<i>unfortunately </i>nothing happened.</b>

10:56.654 --> 11:00.704
<b>Oh. To tell the truth...</b>

11:02.414 --> 11:08.044
<b>If it was with you, I wouldn't have minded
doing it, maybe just the once.</b>

11:09.584 --> 11:15.094
<b>That's the sort of important thing that,
in the future, you should say sooner.</b>

11:34.274 --> 11:36.904
<b>Y-You met up with Mom?</b>

11:36.904 --> 11:41.824
<b>Yep. If she hadn't been there,
we'd be food for the fishes by now.</b>

11:41.824 --> 11:47.334
<b>Oh. So she saved us once again.</b>

11:50.504 --> 11:57.674
<b>It seems like maybe Mom knew,
on that day, that she was going to die.</b>

11:57.674 --> 12:00.974
<b>Yeah, that might be true.</b>

12:00.974 --> 12:04.934
<b>But even if, hypothetically,
she had known...</b>

12:04.934 --> 12:08.604
<b>I wish... she were alive.</b>

12:12.564 --> 12:15.354
<b>Did she say anything?</b>

12:15.354 --> 12:18.524
<b>She said we should
nurture these friendships.</b>

12:18.524 --> 12:20.154
<b>I see...</b>

12:21.154 --> 12:23.954
<b>Someday soon, will you
come with me to a florist?</b>

12:23.954 --> 12:25.244
<b>A florist?</b>

12:25.244 --> 12:29.414
<b>To tell me what I should
buy for Mom's grave.</b>

12:34.084 --> 12:37.004
<b></b>Japan  Tokyo

12:34.084 --> 12:37.004
<b>Yui Saikawa</b>

12:37.844 --> 12:40.674
<b>Are you sure that's what you want?</b>

12:40.674 --> 12:42.514
<b>Yeah, it'll suffice.</b>

12:42.514 --> 12:45.264
<b>But it's extremely ordinary.</b>

12:45.264 --> 12:48.184
<b>Kimizuka-<i>san</i>, you're very ordinary
in both body and soul,</b>

12:48.184 --> 12:50.724
<b>so if you go wearing ordinary
clothing on top of that,</b>

12:50.724 --> 12:53.024
<b>you'll vanish right into the scenery.</b>

12:53.024 --> 12:55.274
<b>Not likely...</b>

12:57.104 --> 13:01.784
<b>I can envision it... A future where you're
just an extra in the background.</b>

13:01.784 --> 13:03.364
<b>Hey!</b>

13:04.534 --> 13:06.494
<b>You're the worst.</b>

13:08.374 --> 13:12.704
<b>It seems you were watching me
the whole time with that left eye.</b>

13:12.704 --> 13:14.914
<b>You were a huge help, Saikawa.</b>

13:14.914 --> 13:20.754
<b>I only did what was common sense.
After all, I am the sidekick's sidekick.</b>

13:24.924 --> 13:28.094
<b>More importantly, is it okay
that you're here with me?</b>

13:28.094 --> 13:32.354
<b>There's going to be a party
in gratitude to you, right?</b>

13:32.354 --> 13:36.854
<b>Yeah, although I told them
they didn't need to do that.</b>

13:36.854 --> 13:39.274
<b>Well, they do owe you their lives.</b>

13:39.274 --> 13:43.824
<b>It's thanks to you that they're able to
be safely homeward bound like this.</b>

13:45.404 --> 13:49.374
<b>Ooh, yikes! It's rehearsal time!</b>

13:49.374 --> 13:51.034
<b>Rehearsal?</b>

13:51.034 --> 13:54.204
<b>I'm going to perform live
during the party.</b>

13:54.204 --> 13:55.914
<b>After an incident like that,</b>

13:55.914 --> 14:00.544
<b>I thought it'd be nice to create
as many fun memories as possible.</b>

14:00.544 --> 14:06.804
<b>Furthermore, music and smiles stick with
people more when they're dispirited.</b>

14:06.804 --> 14:12.604
<b>It's a great chance for me to gain
more worshippers--er, fans.</b>

14:12.604 --> 14:14.024
<b>Saikawa...</b>

14:14.024 --> 14:19.484
<b>Right! Time to display the full force
of Yui Saikawa, world's cutest idol!</b>

14:26.694 --> 14:27.994
<b>Fuubi-<i>san</i>!</b>

14:28.994 --> 14:30.284
<b>Hey.</b>

14:32.534 --> 14:34.454
<b>So what are you gonna do?</b>

14:35.794 --> 14:40.124
<b>I still can't tell Natsunagi
about... that.</b>

14:40.124 --> 14:42.504
<b>I see.</b>

14:42.504 --> 14:46.554
<b>Well, you can handle it as you see fit.</b>

14:58.604 --> 15:00.194
<b>Did you wait long?</b>

15:02.694 --> 15:05.074
<b>Why are you dressed like that?</b>

15:07.194 --> 15:09.534
<b>We can't seem to coordinate outfits, eh?</b>

15:09.534 --> 15:12.494
<b>What's with that jacket? Doesn't suit you.</b>

15:12.494 --> 15:15.084
<b>Saikawa bought it for me.</b>

15:15.084 --> 15:17.704
<b>Ooh, that fact is going
to turn anyone off.</b>

15:17.704 --> 15:19.624
<b>Don't go all "traditional norms" on me.</b>

15:19.624 --> 15:22.254
<b>Oh, excuse me...</b>

15:35.354 --> 15:37.854
<b>So, Natsunagi...</b>

15:37.854 --> 15:39.354
<b>What is it?</b>

15:39.354 --> 15:41.644
<b>About what happens next...</b>

15:42.944 --> 15:46.364
<b>Will you continue to serve
as a legendary detective?</b>

15:47.944 --> 15:52.744
<b>The truth is that, after all,
my confidence is lacking.</b>

15:52.744 --> 15:56.084
<b>This last time, I couldn't
play any active role.</b>

15:56.084 --> 16:02.714
<b>Instead, I was nothing but a burden;
you and Yui-<i>chan </i>had to save me.</b>

16:02.714 --> 16:07.464
<b>What's more, in the end,
I fell back on her.</b>

16:07.464 --> 16:09.764
<b>Ultimately, I'm--</b>

16:09.764 --> 16:12.344
<b>I heard it from Siesta herself...</b>

16:13.684 --> 16:18.224
<b>...that you lent your body
to her of your own volition.</b>

16:23.734 --> 16:27.024
<b>You're telling me to use your body?</b>

16:27.024 --> 16:31.904
<b>Uh-huh. That's my condition in exchange
for hearing out your wishes.</b>

16:31.904 --> 16:33.994
<b>But is that okay?</b>

16:33.994 --> 16:40.544
<b>This body belongs to you. It's yours
and only yours. He said that, too, right?</b>

16:40.544 --> 16:42.414
<b>I guess so.</b>

16:42.414 --> 16:51.264
<b>These hands, legs... from the ends of
my hair down to my toes, it's all mine.</b>

16:51.264 --> 16:55.644
<b>But... not the heart.</b>

16:57.144 --> 17:00.434
<b>That's why I want you to switch
your consciousness for mine</b>

17:00.434 --> 17:04.944
<b>and go save Kimizuka,
who's battling the enemy even now.</b>

17:04.944 --> 17:12.494
<b>I've already died. It's not my place to
be involved with him. Furthermore...</b>

17:13.654 --> 17:19.284
<b>...it might be troubling for Sidekick
if I were to show up again now.</b>

17:19.284 --> 17:24.164
<b>Could be. You can see with your own
eyes whether that happens, right?</b>

17:24.164 --> 17:25.674
<b>That's irresponsible.</b>

17:25.674 --> 17:30.544
<b>Well, you're the one who suddenly
switched into emo-girl mode.</b>

17:30.544 --> 17:34.924
<b>It truly seems like we just
don't see eye to eye.</b>

17:38.594 --> 17:40.394
<b>All right.</b>

17:41.514 --> 17:44.564
<b>I just have to go to him, right?</b>

17:45.564 --> 17:46.944
<b>Umm...</b>

17:48.944 --> 17:54.744
<b>Thank you for giving me life,
legendary detective.</b>

17:54.744 --> 17:57.324
<b>You're welcome.</b>

17:57.324 --> 18:06.084
<b>But thank <i>you</i>... for making use
of my life, legendary detective.</b>

18:15.464 --> 18:21.144
<b>Your words set Siesta into motion,
and that saved my life.</b>

18:22.814 --> 18:27.484
<b>Natsunagi has gifts that she
herself isn't even aware of.</b>

18:27.484 --> 18:32.444
<b>Natsunagi, at that time, set a spark to
emotions I'd been keeping sealed up.</b>

18:32.444 --> 18:37.404
<b>And she caused me to recall once again
the mission I was meant to fulfill.</b>

18:37.404 --> 18:39.494
<b>During the sapphire case,</b>

18:39.494 --> 18:45.454
<b>Natsunagi saw what Saikawa truly
desired more quickly than I did.</b>

18:45.454 --> 18:52.594
<b>And this time, too, she managed
to move even Siesta with her caring.</b>

18:52.594 --> 18:55.304
<b>Without a doubt,
Natsunagi is capable of proffering</b>

18:55.304 --> 18:59.304
<b>the words or action that a person
most wishes for at some moment.</b>

18:59.304 --> 19:03.304
<b>She has that kind of power. That's why...</b>

19:04.354 --> 19:07.434
<b>You're the best legendary detective.</b>

19:08.944 --> 19:15.074
<b>After all, a detective exists to grant
what the client wishes, right?</b>

19:15.074 --> 19:17.904
<b>You're manipulating me.</b>

19:17.904 --> 19:21.994
<b>But... yeah. I'll do it.</b>

19:22.994 --> 19:25.284
<b>Because I was asked to as well.</b>

19:25.284 --> 19:28.504
<b>Asked to? You don't mean by Siesta?</b>

19:28.504 --> 19:29.914
<b>Yep.</b>

19:29.914 --> 19:34.174
<b>That was the condition for her to take
on that task for me, just the one time.</b>

19:34.174 --> 19:40.514
<b>Nagisa Natsunagi, Yui Saikawa,
Charlotte Arisaka Anderson...</b>

19:40.514 --> 19:43.264
<b>...and Kimihiko Kimizuka.</b>

19:44.264 --> 19:47.644
<b>I want the four of you to bring down SPES.</b>

19:48.524 --> 19:54.524
<b>You four carry my inheritance
within; you're my final wish.</b>

19:57.234 --> 19:58.944
<b>Now I see.</b>

20:00.784 --> 20:03.994
<b>At this moment, I knew for certain</b>

20:03.994 --> 20:06.994
<b>I'd taken up the legendary
detective's dying wishes.</b>

20:06.994 --> 20:12.794
<b>Still, none of this changes
my lack of confidence, though.</b>

20:12.794 --> 20:17.804
<b>You're fine. In the lacking confidence
game, I have no superior.</b>

20:17.804 --> 20:21.094
<b>That's the most awful form of
one-upsmanship I've ever heard.</b>

20:21.094 --> 20:27.224
<b>You may also be thinking Siesta was,
unlike yourself, perfect and superhuman,</b>

20:27.224 --> 20:28.764
<b>but she was surprisingly flawed.</b>

20:28.764 --> 20:30.224
<b>Really?</b>

20:30.224 --> 20:34.234
<b>Yes, really. She could get surprisingly
carried away by the moment's mood.</b>

20:34.234 --> 20:37.694
<b>At one point, for some reason,
we wound up together in bed--</b>

20:38.614 --> 20:40.994
<b>Hey, Natsunagi...?</b>

20:47.034 --> 20:51.254
<b>Umm, today... after this...</b>

20:51.254 --> 20:54.004
<b>...will you come to my room?</b>

20:54.004 --> 20:57.294
<b>Huh? What are you saying?</b>

21:00.964 --> 21:05.264
<b>Wait, you're not...</b>

21:05.264 --> 21:07.604
<b>Which do you think?</b>

21:12.144 --> 21:15.274
<b>Attention passengers.</b>

21:16.654 --> 21:20.154
<b>We cannot provide details
at this time; however...</b>

21:22.154 --> 21:26.864
<b>Is there a detective on board?</b>

21:35.214 --> 21:40.544
<b>The detective is already dead. But...</b>

21:43.054 --> 21:47.724
<b>...her dying wish will never die.</b>

21:45.824 --> 21:49.684
From the very moment you caught my eye

21:45.824 --> 21:49.684
<b>ki</b><b>mi </b><b>wo </b><b>mi</b><b>te</b><b>ta </b><b>a</b><b>no </b><b>hi </b><b>ka</b><b>ra</b>

21:49.864 --> 21:57.804
It felt like everything would change

21:49.864 --> 21:57.804
<b>su</b><b>be</b><b>te </b><b>ga </b><b></b><b>ka</b><b>wa</b><b>ru </b><b>yo</b><b>u </b><b>na </b><b>ki </b><b>ga </b><b>shi</b><b>te</b><b>ta</b>

21:51.184 --> 21:57.314
<b>So... it's too soon
to call this an epilogue.</b>

22:06.034 --> 22:09.864
I dimly remember the outlines of a dream

22:06.034 --> 22:09.864
<b>yu</b><b>me </b><b>wo </b><b>mi</b><b>te</b><b>ta </b><b>ki </b><b>ga </b><b>shi</b><b>ta</b>

22:10.174 --> 22:15.584
Echoing with footsteps whose sound is now lost

22:10.174 --> 22:15.584
<b>i</b><b>ma </b><b>ja</b><b>a </b><b>mo </b><b>ki</b><b>ko</b><b>e</b><b>na</b><b>i </b><b>a</b><b>shi</b><b></b><b>o</b><b>to </b><b>de</b>

22:16.124 --> 22:19.844
Yet when I opened my eyes

22:16.124 --> 22:19.844
<b>me </b><b>wo </b><b>a</b><b>ke</b><b>re</b><b>ba </b><b>i</b><b>tsu</b><b>mo </b><b>to</b>

22:20.274 --> 22:25.274
You were missing, as always

22:20.274 --> 22:25.274
<b>o</b><b>na</b><b>ji </b><b>ta</b><b>da </b><b>hi</b><b>to</b><b>ri </b><b>ki</b><b>ta</b><b>i </b><b></b><b>shi</b><b>te</b><b>i</b><b>ta</b>

22:25.644 --> 22:29.494
You know, all those things I was unable to say

22:25.644 --> 22:29.494
<b>ne</b><b>e, </b><b>ki</b><b>mi </b><b>ni </b><b></b><b>i</b><b>e</b><b>na</b><b>ka</b><b>t</b><b>ta </b><b>ko</b><b>to</b>

22:29.744 --> 22:34.334
Have remained bottled up to this day

22:29.744 --> 22:34.334
<b>i</b><b>ma </b><b>mo </b><b>to</b><b>ji</b><b>ko</b><b>me</b><b>te</b><b>ru</b>

22:35.594 --> 22:37.834
My heart is still searching

22:35.594 --> 22:37.834
<b>a</b><b>no </b><b>se</b><b>ka</b><b>i </b><b>de </b><b>mi</b><b>tsu</b><b>ke</b><b>ta</b>

22:37.974 --> 22:40.234
For that important thing

22:37.974 --> 22:40.234
<b>ta</b><b>i</b><b>se</b><b>tsu </b><b>na </b><b>na</b><b>ni</b><b>ka </b><b>wo</b>

22:40.494 --> 22:44.904
It discovered in that world.

22:40.494 --> 22:44.904
<b>ko</b><b>no </b><b>ko</b><b>ko</b><b>ro </b><b>wa </b><b>sa</b><b>ga</b><b>shi</b><b>mo</b><b>to</b><b>me</b><b>te</b><b>ru</b>

22:45.184 --> 22:47.884
Hey, I want us to always smile together

22:45.184 --> 22:47.884
<b>ne</b><b>e, </b><b>zu</b><b>t</b><b>to </b><b>ko</b><b>ko </b><b>de </b><b>ki</b><b>mi </b><b>to</b>

22:48.104 --> 22:50.534
So right here and now

22:48.104 --> 22:50.534
<b>wa</b><b>ra</b><b>t</b><b>te </b><b>i</b><b>ra</b><b>re</b><b>ru </b><b>yo</b><b>u </b><b>ni</b>

22:50.814 --> 22:54.324
I'll make you a promise

22:50.814 --> 22:54.324
<b>ya</b><b>ku</b><b>so</b><b>ku </b><b>wo </b><b>su</b><b>ru </b><b>yo</b>

22:55.964 --> 22:58.504
That will transcend time

22:55.964 --> 22:58.504
<b>to</b><b>ki </b><b>wo </b><b>ko</b><b>e</b><b>te, </b><b>i</b><b>ma</b>

23:19.234 --> 23:24.574
<b>Okay, Sidekick. Remember this...</b>

23:25.864 --> 23:29.704
<b>The name of the person who will someday
awaken you from your sleep is...</b>

23:31.574 --> 23:33.324
<b>...Nagisa.</b>

23:34.994 --> 23:37.164
<b>Nagisa Natsunagi.</b>
